"In Safari, Notes, Mail, or another text app, touch and hold a word, then adjust the selection handles to include the text you want to change." = "在 Safari、备忘录、邮件或其他文本应用中，长按一个词，然后拖动选择手柄，选中要处理的文字。";
"Highlight a sentence, paragraph, or message before opening the menu." = "先高亮一个句子、段落或消息，再打开菜单。";
"Open the action menu" = "打开操作菜单";
"Tap Share or the More button in the selection menu. If Runse is not visible, open More and enable it for next time." = "在选择菜单中点按“分享”或“更多”。如果看不到 Runse，请打开“更多”并为下次启用它。";
"Look for the system share sheet or action list after selecting text." = "选择文本后，找到系统分享面板或操作列表。";
"Pin Runse" = "固定 Runse";
"If Runse is hidden in More, enable it and drag it near the top so it appears directly next time." = "如果 Runse 隐藏在“更多”中，请启用它并拖到靠前位置，这样下次会直接显示。";
"You only need to pin Runse once for each app or menu style where you use it." = "在每个使用 Runse 的 App 或菜单样式中，只需固定一次。";
"Enable Runse" = "启用 Runse";
"Drag Runse near the top" = "将 Runse 拖到靠前位置";
"Choose Runse" = "选择 Runse";
"Tap Runse in the share sheet or action list. The selected text opens in Runse with the available actions." = "在分享面板或操作列表中点按 Runse。选中的文本会在 Runse 中打开，并显示可用操作。";
"Runse receives only the selected text and prepares it for transformation." = "Runse 只会接收选中的文本，并准备进行转换。";
"Refine or translate" = "润色或翻译";
"Choose Refine to improve wording, or Translate to convert the text into your default language. Copy the result back where you need it." = "选择“润色”来优化表达，或选择“翻译”将文本转换为默认语言。然后把结果复制回需要的位置。";
"Use Refine for clearer writing. Use Translate when the selected text should change languages." = "想让表达更清晰时使用“润色”；需要切换语言时使用“翻译”。";
"Adjust defaults" = "调整默认设置";
"Open Settings to change the default translation language. Open Providers if you need to update the model, endpoint, or API key." = "打开“设置”可更改默认翻译语言。需要更新模型、端点或 API 密钥时，请打开“提供商”。";
"You can reopen this guide later from Settings." = "之后可从“设置”再次打开本指南。";
"Touch and hold this sample text, then drag the handles to select the part you want Runse to process." = "长按这段示例文本，然后拖动手柄选择要让 Runse 处理的部分。";
"The product update is good but it sounds a little rough. Please make it clearer for customers." = "产品更新不错，但听起来还有点生硬。请让它对客户更清晰。";
"Settings keeps the guide available and stores your default translation language." = "“设置”会保留本指南入口，并保存默认翻译语言。";
